- @campaigning_braun: Time to hit the campaign trail! 
- @campaigning_rosenfeld: Time to hit the campaign trail! 
- @campaigning_eckener: Time to hit the campaign trail! 
- @campaigning_reactionary: Time to hit the campaign trail! 
- @campaigning_thalmann: Time to hit the campaign trail! 

@campaigning_braun
view-if: braun_campaign

We have a plethora of campaign options at our disposal.

- @iron_front
- @media
- @center_glaze
- @communist_glaze
- @campaigning
- @hope: Let's hope the Commonwealth will make the correct choice.

@iron_front
title: Rally the full strength of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span> to support Bristol.
view-if: iron_front_formed
on-arrival: radicalization = 3 if radicalization > 3; commons_marcher += radicalization + 3; burgher_marcher += radicalization + 2; disfavored_marcher += radicalization + 2; pro_republic += 3; nationalism -= 3; knight_dissent -= 10; knight_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 10; banner_strength += 100; commons_royalist -= 3 if strife >= 5 and far_right_paramilitary; burgher_royalist -= 3 if strife >= 5 and far_right_paramilitary; disfavored_royalist -= 3 if strife >= 5 and far_right_paramilitary
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/iron_front_poster.png
go-to: campaigning_braun

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span> immediately gets to work, rallying around its slogan of opposing <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Fascism</span>, <span style="color:rgb(90, 0, 0);">Halsmarkism</span>, and <span style="color: #808080;">Monarchism</span>, which is especially relevant in this election.

@media
title: Use our radio stations to broadcast in favor of Bristol.
subtitle: -1 resource
choose-if: radio >= 2 and resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if radio < 2: We haven't sufficiently built up our radio infrastructure yet. ?] [? if resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: resources -= 1; burgher_marcher += (radio + commercialized_media); guild_marcher += (radio + commercialized_media); commons_marcher += (campaign_media + radio - 2); disfavored_marcher += (campaign_media + radio); burgher_royalist -= (radio + commercialized_media); guild_royalist -= (radio + commercialized_media); commons_royalist -= (campaign_media + radio - 2); disfavored_royalist -= (campaign_media + radio); socialism += 3; nationalism -= 1; nationalism -= 2 if pacifism > 1; pro_republic += (radio + commercialized_media)
face-image: img/poster_0.jpg
max-visits: 1
go-to: campaigning_braun

We are able to broadcast radio addresses urging turnout for Bristol, spreading our message to the middle classes in hopes of overcoming their antipathy toward <span style="color: #c00000;">socialism</span>.

@center_glaze
title: We persuade the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] to take a more active role in our campaign efforts.
subtitle: The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] isn't pulling their weight. -1 resource
choose-if: unionist_support_marcher == 1 and ((unionist_relation >= 60 and unionist_ideology == "Right") or (unionist_relation >= 45 and unionist_ideology == "Left")) and resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if unionist_support_marcher != 1: The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] doesn't support Bristol. ?][? if (unionist_relation < 60 and unionist_ideology == "Right") or (unionist_relation < 45 and unionist_ideology == "Left"): Our relations aren't good enough. ?] [? if resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: resources -= 1; pro_republic += 3; unionist_glaze_marcher = 1; faithful_royalist -= 3; faithful_marcher += 3; faithful_unionist += 2; landed_marcher += 1; unionist_relation += 5; ddp_left += 2; gold_left += 3; ddp_cohesion += 1; lvp_left += 2
face-image: img/center_poster.jpg
max-visits: 1
go-to: campaigning_braun

The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] has not been the most enthusiastic supporter of Bristol. However, by leveraging our connections with their left wing and trade unions, we push them toward a more active role in the campaign. This should help Bristol secure more votes from their base.

@communist_glaze
title: We persuade the <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span> to take a more active role in our campaign efforts.
subtitle: This will alienate bourgeois voters! -2 resources
choose-if: collectivist_support_marcher == 1 and (collectivist_relation >= 70 or (collectivist_relation >= 55 and collectivist_leader == "Conciliators")) and resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: [? if collectivist_support_marcher != 1: The <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivists</span> doesn't support Bristol. ?][? if (collectivist_relation < 70 or (collectivist_relation < 55 and collectivist_leader == "Conciliators")): Our relations aren't good enough. ?] [? if resources < 2: Not enough resources. (need 2) ?]
on-arrival: resources -= 2; collectivist_glaze_marcher = 1; commons_marcher += 3; commons_collectivist += 5; commons_royalist -= 3; disfavored_collectivist += 3; disfavored_royalist -= 3; unionist_relation -= 10; ddp_relation -= 10; gold_relation -= 10; lvp_relation -= 10; gold_right += 5; ddp_right += 3; ddp_cohesion -= 2; lvp_right += 5; unionist_support_marcher = 0 if (unionist_relation < 60 and unionist_ideology == "Right") or (unionist_relation < 50 and unionist_ideology == "Left"); burgher_marcher -= 3; guild_marcher -= 3; faithful_marcher -= 3
face-image: img/kpd_poster.jpg
max-visits: 1
go-to: campaigning_braun

Despite our earlier insistence on keeping the <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span>' support low-key, we have now decided that their full backing in the upcoming election is worth the risk of alienating bourgeois <span style="color: #000000;">repu</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">bli</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">cans</span>. As a result, we are now openly participating in joint rallies in support of Bristol.

[? if (unionist_relation < 60 and unionist_ideology == "Right") or (unionist_relation < 50 and unionist_ideology == "Left"): The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] has withdrawn their endorsement of Bristol. ?]

@campaigning
title: Accelerate campaign efforts in general.
subtitle: This will cost us 1 resource.
view-if: not campaigning_seen
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; campaigning_seen = 1; campaigning_count = 0
max-visits: 1
go-to: campaign_menu


@campaign_menu


Since it's election season, we are able to accelerate campaigning efforts. Buy one campaign, get another one completely free of charge!

- @workers: Add 1 "Worker" to the cart.
- @middle_class: Add 1 "Middle Class" to the cart.
- @rural: Add 1 "Rural" to the cart.
- @unemployed: Add "Unemployed" to the cart.
- @catholics: Add "Catholic" to the cart.
- @checkout

@workers
view-if: campaigning_count < 2
on-arrival: commons_marcher += 3*(1 - dissent); campaigning_count += 1
go-to: campaign_menu


@middle_class
view-if: campaigning_count < 2
on-arrival: burgher_marcher += 3*(1 - dissent); guild_marcher += 3*(1 - dissent); burgher_marcher += 2*(1 - dissent) if peoples_party; guild_marcher += 2*(1 - dissent) if peoples_party; campaigning_count += 1
go-to: campaign_menu


@rural
view-if: campaigning_count < 2
on-arrival: landed_marcher += 3*(1 - dissent); landed_marcher += 3*(1 - dissent) if peoples_party; campaigning_count += 1
go-to: campaign_menu


@unemployed
view-if: campaigning_count < 2
on-arrival: disfavored_marcher += 3*(1 - dissent); campaigning_count += 1
go-to: campaign_menu


@catholics
view-if: campaigning_count < 2 and peoples_party
on-arrival: faithful_marcher += 3*(1 - dissent); campaigning_count += 1
go-to: campaign_menu


@checkout
title: Checkout your order.
go-to: campaigning_braun if braun_campaign; campaigning_eckener if eckener_campaign; campaigning_rosenfeld if rosenfeld_campaign; campaigning_thalmann if marcher_support_thalmann; campaigning_reactionary if marcher_support_reactionary


@hope

Where has hope got us the past few years?

@campaigning_rosenfeld
view-if: rosenfeld_campaign

We have a plethora of campaign options at our disposal.

- @iron_front_rosenfeld
- @media_rosenfeld
- @party_discipline_rosenfeld
- @communist_glaze_rosenfeld
- @campaigning
- @hope: Let's hope the Commonwealth will make the correct choice.

@iron_front_rosenfeld
title: Rally the full strength of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span> to support Pendrigon.
view-if: iron_front_formed
on-arrival: radicalization = 3 if radicalization > 3; commons_marcher += radicalization + 3; burgher_marcher += radicalization + 2; disfavored_marcher += radicalization + 2; pro_republic += 3; nationalism -= 3; knight_dissent -= 10; knight_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 10; banner_strength += 100; commons_royalist -= 3 if strife >= 5 and far_right_paramilitary; burgher_royalist -= 3 if strife >= 5 and far_right_paramilitary; disfavored_royalist -= 3 if strife >= 5 and far_right_paramilitary
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/iron_front_poster.png
go-to: campaigning_rosenfeld

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span> immediately gets to work, rallying around its slogan of opposing <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Fascism</span> and <span style="color: #808080;">Monarchism</span>, which is especially relevant in this election. This will help us shore up support among more reluctant workers.

@media_rosenfeld
title: Use our radio stations to broadcast in favor of Pendrigon.
subtitle: -1 resource
